			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"The Damselette"
				],
				"points": [
					{
						"sceneId": 3,
						"position": [
							3537.532,
							452.648,
							4178.716
						],
						"pointId": 16568
					},
					{
						"sceneId": 3,
						"position": [
							3538.825,
							452.648,
							4179.689
						],
						"pointId": 16573
					}
				]
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 402460201,
					"content": "Citlali sure drank a lot last night, huh... Wonder if she's even awake...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402460202
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 402460202,
					"content": "Good morning.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402460203
					],
					"speakerTitle": "The Damselette"
				},
				{
					"id": 402460203,
					"content": "Waah! C—Columbina! You, uh, sure know how to make an entrance... What are you doing here?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402460204
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 402460204,
					"content": "We just finished filming a last-minute scene, so I came up to get some fresh air.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402460205
					],
					"speakerTitle": "The Damselette"
				},
				{
					"id": 402460205,
					"content": "The others are still down below discussing what the final scene should be.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402460206
					],
					"speakerTitle": "The Damselette"
				},
				{
					"id": 402460206,
					"content": "You mean, how it should end?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402460207
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 402460207,
					"content": "Yes. They're torn between whether the heroine should reunite with her old friend or not.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402460208
					],
					"speakerTitle": "The Damselette"
				},
				{
					"id": 402460208,
					"content": "Ah... Because the whole point is that she came to her friend's homeland to search for her, right? Paimon almost forgot the plot...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402460209
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 402460209,
					"content": "Yes. Director Furina and Miss Chiori think a tragic ending where the two never meet would be more poignant.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402460210
					],
					"speakerTitle": "The Damselette"
				},
				{
					"id": 402460210,
					"content": "But Director Xavier thinks having the two reunite would make for a more touching and heartwarming ending.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402460211
					],
					"speakerTitle": "The Damselette"
				},
				{
					"id": 402460211,
					"content": "What do you think?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402460212
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 402460212,
					"content": "Me? I... I'm not sure...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402460213
					],
					"speakerTitle": "The Damselette"
				},
				{
					"id": 402460213,
					"content": "On a personal level, of course I want to see her again... of course I want to experience that moment where we reunite... even if it's just for the Kameras.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402460214
					],
					"speakerTitle": "The Damselette"
				},
				{
					"id": 402460214,
					"content": "But that means... an actor would have to take her place, and that makes me feel...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402460215
					],
					"speakerTitle": "The Damselette"
				},
				{
					"id": 402460215,
					"content": "...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402460216
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 402460216,
					"content": "Don't stress about that for now.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402460217
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 402460217,
					"content": "Huh?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402460218
					],
					"speakerTitle": "The Damselette"
				},
				{
					"id": 402460218,
					"content": "Yeah! Don't look so worried! Making a film is supposed to be fun!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402460219
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 402460219,
					"content": "B—Besides, it's all gonna work out! You can trust Paimon on that!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402460220
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 402460220,
					"content": "Work out... how?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402460221
					],
					"speakerTitle": "The Damselette"
				},
				{
					"id": 402460221,
					"content": "Uh, well... Y'know...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402460222
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 402460222,
					"content": "It'll all get tied up in a nice little bow. You'll see.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402460223
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 402460223,
					"content": "Yep! Exactly!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402460224
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 402460224,
					"content": "Hehe... Okay. I trust you.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402460225
					],
					"speakerTitle": "The Damselette"
				},
				{
					"id": 402460225,
					"content": "I'll just focus on having fun for now.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402460226
					],
					"speakerTitle": "The Damselette"
				},
				{
					"id": 402460226,
					"content": "#Well, well, look who we have here! {NICKNAME} and Paimon!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402460227
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Furina"
				},
				{
					"id": 402460227,
					"content": "Aw, the lighting specialist and clapper loader that never were...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402460228
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Chiori"
				},
				{
					"id": 402460228,
					"content": "Uh, yeah... We kinda went AWOL didn't we. Sorry about that.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402460229
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 402460229,
					"content": "Hehe, seriously, don't worry about it. Everything's going smoothly on our end, so just do what you need to do.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402460230,
						402460231
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Chiori"
				},
				{
					"id": 402460230,
					"content": "Thanks for understanding...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402460232
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 402460232,
					"content": "You seem to be in better spirits now, Miss Columbina. I apologize if our earlier discussion put you on the spot...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402460233
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Furina"
				},
				{
					"id": 402460233,
					"content": "#It's okay, I'm fine now. {NICKNAME} and Paimon talked me through it.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402460234
					],
					"speakerTitle": "The Damselette"
				},
				{
					"id": 402460234,
					"content": "So, what are your thoughts on the ending then? Should we have them reunite or not?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402460235
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Furina"
				},
				{
					"id": 402460235,
					"content": "We should... tie everything up in bows.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402460236
					],
					"speakerTitle": "The Damselette"
				},
				{
					"id": 402460236,
					"content": "...Huh?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Furina"
				},
				{
					"id": 402460231,
					"content": "We'll definitely make it up to you...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402460232
					]
				}
			]
		},
